{"availability":"available","full":"Mormolykos/longbook-rag-eval-lab","name":"longbook-rag-eval-lab","description":"MCP-enabled evaluation and claim-grounding toolkit for long-document RAG systems - retrieval evaluation (5 methods), claim verification, a local FastAPI app, a local stdio MCP server for Claude Code/Codex, plus the hosted BookProof demo.","category":"Design","language":"Python","stars":1,"forks":0,"created":"2026-06-19T21:10:17Z","updated":"2026-06-26T18:59:09Z","license":"MIT","branch":"main","homepage":null,"topics":["claim-verification","claude-code","codex","fastapi","information-retrieval","llm-evaluation","long-context","mcp","model-context-protocol","nlp","portfolio","python","rag","rag-evaluation","retrieval-augmented-generation"],"demo":"https://tts.bedvibe.studio/bookproof/app/","color":"#193546","ink":"#a6d6e8","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-16T23:49:29.984Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-16T23:49:29.984Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-16T23:49:29.984Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-06T06:44:47.062Z","stars":1,"forks":0},{"at":"2026-10-08T07:32:45.088Z","stars":1,"forks":0},{"at":"2026-10-10T17:26:45.843Z","stars":1,"forks":0},{"at":"2026-10-16T23:49:29.984Z","stars":1,"forks":0}],"technologies":["Python"],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["An MCP-enabled evaluation and claim-grounding toolkit for long-document RAG systems.","LongBook Verifier measures whether retrieval methods and AI outputs are actually grounded in long narrative manuscripts — by retrieving evidence from the document and scoring coverage, deterministically and without external model APIs.","Short-answer correctness and evidence grounding can diverge: a model can give a plausible answer that the document doesn't actually support. LongBook Verifier separates those signals so you can audit whether outputs and retrieval are grounded in long manuscripts — useful for manuscript QA and reproducible long-document evaluation."],"features":[],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/Mormol